1
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:25,500
It doesn't look like an accidental fall.

2
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:29,240
Sir, please don't dissect my dad.

3
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:31,720
He's already mangled enough.

4
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:34,880
Please,

5
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:36,800
let him go in one piece.

6
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:39,120
Stop investigating.

7
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:40,640
Don't dissect him.

8
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:50,400
Han, a forensic doctor's scalpel
only recognizes evidence,

9
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:51,960
not tears.

10
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,880
Han, what's wrong?

11
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,040
You look so pale.

12
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:04,200
I'm fine.

13
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:08,960
Star, time is running out.

14
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,560
How exactly did she die?

15
00:01:10,680 --> 00:01:12,640
She couldn't think straight
and hanged herself, right?

16
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:14,700
Just say it, and this will all be over.

17
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:22,840
Han, don't blame yourself.

18
00:01:23,720 --> 00:01:25,120
But remember,

19
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:32,320
there can be no personal feelings
under the scalpel.

20
00:01:36,080 --> 00:01:37,400
Master! Master!

21
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:50,400
No. A survival game

22
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:52,800
would never kindly offer
a safe shortcut to clear the level.

23
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:53,600
This is a play.

24
00:01:53,759 --> 00:01:55,680
If I follow her wishes
and say it was a hanging,

25
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:58,200
it means I completely accept
the script written by the villain,

26
00:01:58,200 --> 00:02:00,080
becoming a marionette on this stage.

27
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:02,200
The follow-up will only lead
to a deadly trap.

28
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:04,600
The only way out is to flip the table

29
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:06,200
and forcefully tear a rift in the plot.

30
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:09,199
The deceased was first knocked unconscious
by a blunt force trauma to the back of the head,

31
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,800
followed by strangulation.

32
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,560
The killer knocked her out first,

33
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:14,120
then strangled her with a piano wire,

34
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:15,400
disguising it as a hanging.

35
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:16,460
This is a homicide.

36
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:20,600
Han, watch out!

37
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:21,680
Xiao Han, get down!

38
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:33,600
You refuse a toast

39
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:35,000
only to drink a forfeit.

40
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:38,400
Since you won't play along,

41
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:41,120
you can all die on the stage!

42
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:58,400
Hurry! While she's dispersed,

43
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,520
follow me into the secret room.

44
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,200
Once she gathers her evil aura,

45
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:03,000
not even the gods can save you.

46
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:18,320
There's a secret room like this
behind the dressing room?

47
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:22,800
If the Marshal wants to live,

48
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,600
do not trust the Star beside you.

49
00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:26,640
At midnight, the Star

50
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:28,400
will surely take
the Marshal's heart blood.

51
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:29,600
The real demon is...

52
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,960
Li Xiang wrote these words
by biting her finger.

53
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,490
She warned us with her life.

54
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:36,320
The dead end in the third act
is forcing me to act.

55
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:37,880
The Star, the Marshal...

56
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:41,000
Does this mean Han will kill Yang?

57
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:43,760
This is the script for the third act.

58
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:45,680
The so-called destined person
by the system

59
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:46,880
has always been...

60
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:49,040
How are you so familiar
with this secret passage?

61
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:50,880
What exactly is Su Lingyue?

62
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:57,400
Because I am the only surviving

63
00:03:57,400 --> 00:04:00,280
stagehand of this troupe
from a hundred years ago.

64
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:07,240
Su Lingyue is a theatrical fiend
who died on this stage a century ago.

65
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,440
She feeds on resentment

66
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:12,570
by dragging living people in to perform
deadly plays of mutual slaughter.

67
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:14,770
If you had lied along with her just now,

68
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:16,240
you would have ended up like me,

69
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:18,680
slowly turning into marionettes
for her to control.

70
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,240
So when I called out homicide just now,

71
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,920
it was like forcefully
tearing up her script,

72
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:22,920
forcing her to reveal her true form.

73
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:24,480
You broke the second act

74
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:26,080
and bought a glimmer of hope.

75
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:27,880
But once midnight strikes,

76
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:29,840
the third act will forcefully begin.

77
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:31,800
One of you is destined to die.

78
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:35,560
Follow me.

79
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:40,320
These forty-seven pairs
are the audience out front.

80
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:43,720
They were all once living people
just like you.

81
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:47,880
Now they are part of this stage.

82
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,880
What are these?

83
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,040
We can't perform Act III.

84
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:54,640
It's a dead end.

85
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:55,840
We are all puppets.

86
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:57,500
But we still can't get out.

87
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,240
The theater eats people.

88
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,760
Never to be reincarnated.

89
00:05:00,760 --> 00:05:03,490
These are the last words
left by past lead actors.

90
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,640
Everyone was

91
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:06,720
eventually forced

92
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:09,360
to kill their Marshal in Act III.

93
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:11,160
And after killing him?

94
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,440
Did they clear the game?

95
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:14,080
After killing the Marshal,

96
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:17,640
the actor's soul is trapped
on stage forever.

97
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:20,360
The Marshal becomes a spectator
in the audience.

98
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,880
An endless cycle.

99
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:23,400
Never to be freed.

100
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,400
I get it.

101
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:33,520
The real demon isn't Su Lingyue at all.

102
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:35,280
If not Su Lingyue, who else could it be?

103
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:37,480
These paintings... 47 Marshals.

104
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,320
Different eras,

105
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:39,360
different clothes.

106
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,680
But they are all sitting

107
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:42,640
in the exact same armchair.

108
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:44,600
The armchair.

109
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:47,360
This chair, having absorbed
the blood of 47 generations,

110
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:49,600
is the true heart of this theater.

111
00:05:49,760 --> 00:05:52,920
Young man, you have a sharp eye.

112
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:55,000
To think you could see through this.

113
00:05:55,159 --> 00:05:57,440
When Su Lingyue died tragically,

114
00:05:57,440 --> 00:06:01,200
all her resentment and blood
poured into this chair.

115
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:04,040
It is the true man-eating demon.

116
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:13,840
This symbol... Could it be Master?

117
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:24,280
Hanzi, if you can read this,

118
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:26,690
it means I didn't escape this game either.

119
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,800
Don't trust the system's rules.

120
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:30,640
The real key to breaking the game...

121
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:32,159
Fifteen minutes until midnight.

122
00:06:32,159 --> 00:06:34,720
Act III of Blood Sacrifice
in the Pear Garden is about to begin.

123
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:36,360
Preparation time is over.

124
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:38,200
Marshal, please take your seat.

125
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:39,860
Actor, please take the stage.

126
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:42,520
Yang,
